[gd_scene format=3]

; The Basalt, under the Slag's plug (map offset (223.5, -193)): a crust of basalt over the foundry, only passed by boring.
; The shaft from the plug drops onto a second plug; under it a cavern split by a cracked wall, a third plug in its floor,
; and at the bottom a slag channel to jump before the hole that falls on into the Crucible. Reached only with the Drill
; (the dive through the Slag's plug), so every crust here gives to it. One way: the shaft is too smooth to climb.

